abstract: >-
  Data, code, and generated artifacts replicating the estimates in the
  paper: a two-engine (R + Python) pipeline from IBGE PNAD Contínua
  2026Q1 microdata and the Eloundou et al. (2024) occupational AI
  exposure index to every table and figure in the manuscript.
